{"id":"forecast-06","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-06/audio-4.mp3","model":"small","duration":966.0,"segments":[{"start":0.27,"end":7.23,"text":"Section 4. You will hear a lecturer talking about the use of games techniques in business.","words":[["Section",0.27,0.89],["4.",0.89,1.41],["You",2.31,2.71],["will",2.71,2.91],["hear",2.91,3.11],["a",3.11,3.27],["lecturer",3.27,3.59],["talking",3.59,4.23],["about",4.23,4.59],["the",4.59,4.81],["use",4.81,5.09],["of",5.09,5.29],["games",5.29,5.69],["techniques",5.69,6.25],["in",6.25,6.81],["business.",6.81,7.23]]},{"start":8.27,"end":69.36,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 31-40 on page 7. Now listen carefully and answer questions 31-40.","words":[["First,",8.27,8.87],["you",9.27,9.45],["have",9.45,9.63],["some",9.63,9.83],["time",9.83,10.21],["to",10.21,10.41],["look",10.41,10.53],["at",10.53,10.67],["questions",10.67,11.09],["31",11.09,12.07],["-40",12.07,12.99],["on",12.99,13.63],["page",13.63,13.87],["7.",13.87,14.29],["Now",64.94,65.28],["listen",65.28,65.6],["carefully",65.6,66.08],["and",66.08,66.6],["answer",66.6,66.88],["questions",66.88,67.36],["31",67.36,68.4],["-40.",68.4,69.36]]},{"start":72.76,"end":78.74,"text":"Today, we are going to look at how the phenomenon known as gamification has really exploded in recent years.","words":[["Today,",72.76,73.38],["we",73.74,73.9],["are",73.9,73.98],["going",73.98,74.14],["to",74.14,74.28],["look",74.28,74.42],["at",74.42,74.54],["how",74.54,74.7],["the",74.7,74.8],["phenomenon",74.8,75.14],["known",75.14,75.64],["as",75.64,75.84],["gamification",75.84,76.44],["has",76.44,77.02],["really",77.02,77.32],["exploded",77.32,77.76],["in",77.76,78.04],["recent",78.04,78.32],["years.",78.32,78.74]]},{"start":78.74,"end":81.12,"text":"So, what exactly is gamification?","words":[["So,",78.74,79.7],["what",79.82,79.96],["exactly",79.96,80.34],["is",80.34,80.7],["gamification?",80.7,81.12]]},{"start":82.28,"end":88.24,"text":"It has been defined as the use of games thinking and mechanics in non-game situations, such","words":[["It",82.28,82.74],["has",82.74,82.92],["been",82.92,83.12],["defined",83.12,83.44],["as",83.44,83.72],["the",83.72,83.86],["use",83.86,84.1],["of",84.1,84.24],["games",84.24,84.56],["thinking",84.56,84.9],["and",84.9,85.2],["mechanics",85.2,85.58],["in",85.58,86.04],["non",86.04,86.46],["-game",86.46,86.8],["situations,",86.8,87.42],["such",88.0,88.24]]},{"start":88.24,"end":88.94,"text":"as for business.","words":[["as",88.24,88.46],["for",88.46,88.7],["business.",88.7,88.94]]},{"start":89.72,"end":92.24,"text":"Up to now, its most common function has been marketing.","words":[["Up",89.72,89.86],["to",89.86,90.02],["now,",90.02,90.26],["its",90.42,90.52],["most",90.52,90.7],["common",90.7,91.0],["function",91.0,91.4],["has",91.4,91.68],["been",91.68,91.84],["marketing.",91.84,92.24]]},{"start":93.32,"end":97.78,"text":"It is extremely popular with big companies, but as we'll see, it also has many other","words":[["It",93.32,93.42],["is",93.42,93.52],["extremely",93.52,93.88],["popular",93.88,94.28],["with",94.28,94.56],["big",94.56,94.76],["companies,",94.76,95.18],["but",95.4,95.54],["as",95.54,95.82],["we'll",95.82,96.06],["see,",96.06,96.34],["it",96.68,96.78],["also",96.78,97.06],["has",97.06,97.3],["many",97.3,97.52],["other",97.52,97.78]]},{"start":97.78,"end":98.08,"text":"uses.","words":[["uses.",97.78,98.08]]},{"start":99.34,"end":102.86,"text":"Gamification techniques work on our natural desire for competition.","words":[["Gamification",99.34,99.9],["techniques",99.9,100.46],["work",100.46,100.88],["on",100.88,101.16],["our",101.16,101.34],["natural",101.34,101.78],["desire",101.78,102.22],["for",102.22,102.4],["competition.",102.4,102.86]]},{"start":103.68,"end":106.4,"text":"One way they do this is by providing a reward.","words":[["One",103.68,103.98],["way",103.98,104.18],["they",104.18,104.34],["do",104.34,104.58],["this",104.58,104.88],["is",104.88,105.04],["by",105.04,105.32],["providing",105.32,105.82],["a",105.82,106.0],["reward.",106.0,106.4]]},{"start":106.4,"end":111.86,"text":"For example, badges or points or providing a type of virtual currency.","words":[["For",106.4,107.1],["example,",107.1,107.52],["badges",107.96,108.42],["or",108.42,108.72],["points",108.72,109.12],["or",109.12,109.78],["providing",109.78,110.24],["a",110.24,110.46],["type",110.46,110.66],["of",110.66,110.82],["virtual",110.82,111.24],["currency.",111.24,111.86]]},{"start":112.72,"end":115.52,"text":"But don't be fooled into thinking the concept is a novel one.","words":[["But",112.72,112.98],["don't",112.98,113.22],["be",113.22,113.32],["fooled",113.32,113.64],["into",113.64,113.84],["thinking",113.84,114.12],["the",114.12,114.34],["concept",114.34,114.72],["is",114.72,114.96],["a",114.96,115.08],["novel",115.08,115.2],["one.",115.2,115.52]]},{"start":116.12,"end":121.34,"text":"Just think of the frequent flyer incentive schemes that were initiated by airlines to try and retain customers.","words":[["Just",116.12,116.32],["think",116.32,116.54],["of",116.54,116.66],["the",116.66,116.76],["frequent",116.76,117.04],["flyer",117.04,117.54],["incentive",117.54,117.8],["schemes",117.8,118.38],["that",118.38,118.58],["were",118.58,118.7],["initiated",118.7,119.1],["by",119.1,119.38],["airlines",119.38,119.9],["to",119.9,120.16],["try",120.16,120.38],["and",120.38,120.5],["retain",120.5,120.78],["customers.",120.78,121.34]]},{"start":122.14,"end":127.74,"text":"In fact, it's been around for years. However, it has become more prolific with advances in technology.","words":[["In",122.14,122.32],["fact,",122.32,122.58],["it's",122.66,122.86],["been",122.86,123.0],["around",123.0,123.24],["for",123.24,123.4],["years.",123.4,123.74],["However,",124.26,124.6],["it",124.92,125.18],["has",125.18,125.38],["become",125.38,125.68],["more",125.68,125.94],["prolific",125.94,126.36],["with",126.36,126.58],["advances",126.58,127.0],["in",127.0,127.24],["technology.",127.24,127.74]]},{"start":128.8,"end":130.92,"text":"So how is gamification being used?","words":[["So",128.8,129.16],["how",129.16,129.36],["is",129.36,129.56],["gamification",129.56,129.96],["being",129.96,130.5],["used?",130.5,130.92]]},{"start":130.92,"end":137.56,"text":"Well, it is seen as an excellent way of obtaining almost instantaneous feedback through common","words":[["Well,",130.92,132.12],["it",132.52,132.68],["is",132.68,132.84],["seen",132.84,133.12],["as",133.12,133.32],["an",133.32,133.42],["excellent",133.42,133.8],["way",133.8,134.08],["of",134.08,134.28],["obtaining",134.28,134.78],["almost",134.78,135.4],["instantaneous",135.4,136.24],["feedback",136.24,136.82],["through",136.82,137.22],["common",137.22,137.56]]},{"start":137.56,"end":138.76,"text":"social media sites.","words":[["social",137.56,137.86],["media",137.86,138.24],["sites.",138.24,138.76]]},{"start":139.38,"end":144.46,"text":"However, there are other areas where it is increasingly being used, in particular as","words":[["However,",139.38,139.72],["there",139.82,139.98],["are",139.98,140.16],["other",140.16,140.46],["areas",140.46,140.98],["where",140.98,141.42],["it",141.42,141.56],["is",141.56,141.66],["increasingly",141.66,142.32],["being",142.32,142.72],["used,",142.72,143.16],["in",143.6,143.7],["particular",143.7,144.06],["as",144.06,144.46]]},{"start":144.46,"end":149.04,"text":"a means of trying to convince people through fun activities to alter their behaviour.","words":[["a",144.46,144.58],["means",144.58,144.76],["of",144.76,145.0],["trying",145.0,145.28],["to",145.28,145.46],["convince",145.46,145.7],["people",145.7,146.2],["through",146.2,146.5],["fun",146.5,146.76],["activities",146.76,147.2],["to",147.2,147.66],["alter",147.66,148.3],["their",148.3,148.56],["behaviour.",148.56,149.04]]},{"start":149.84,"end":154.84,"text":"Another use is in education or training in the workplace, especially when it is just","words":[["Another",149.84,150.3],["use",150.3,150.62],["is",150.62,150.78],["in",150.78,150.9],["education",150.9,151.3],["or",151.3,151.68],["training",151.68,151.98],["in",151.98,152.14],["the",152.14,152.22],["workplace,",152.22,152.62],["especially",153.32,153.8],["when",153.8,154.26],["it",154.26,154.52],["is",154.52,154.66],["just",154.66,154.84]]},{"start":154.84,"end":157.08,"text":"not feasible to train people on the real thing.","words":[["not",154.84,155.02],["feasible",155.02,155.42],["to",155.42,155.68],["train",155.68,155.96],["people",155.96,156.26],["on",156.26,156.46],["the",156.46,156.54],["real",156.54,156.76],["thing.",156.76,157.08]]},{"start":157.08,"end":164.76,"text":"Good examples of this are the aircraft simulators used by pilots, or the urban simulators used by town planners.","words":[["Good",157.08,158.06],["examples",158.06,158.4],["of",158.4,158.66],["this",158.66,158.86],["are",158.86,159.2],["the",159.2,159.68],["aircraft",159.68,160.1],["simulators",160.1,160.78],["used",160.78,160.98],["by",160.98,161.16],["pilots,",161.16,161.58],["or",161.96,162.04],["the",162.04,162.5],["urban",162.5,162.78],["simulators",162.78,163.48],["used",163.48,163.82],["by",163.82,164.04],["town",164.04,164.38],["planners.",164.38,164.76]]},{"start":170.12,"end":173.92,"text":"So let's look at a few examples of the successful implementation of gamification.","words":[["So",170.12,170.32],["let's",170.32,170.56],["look",170.56,170.7],["at",170.7,170.8],["a",170.8,170.92],["few",170.92,171.04],["examples",171.04,171.48],["of",171.48,171.72],["the",171.72,171.84],["successful",171.84,172.4],["implementation",172.4,173.2],["of",173.2,173.44],["gamification.",173.44,173.92]]},{"start":175.06,"end":183.54,"text":"One perhaps surprising use of gamification has been in official campaigns by governments and authorities who have quickly seen its potential.","words":[["One",175.06,175.42],["perhaps",175.42,175.82],["surprising",175.82,176.48],["use",176.48,176.86],["of",176.86,177.02],["gamification",177.02,177.52],["has",177.52,178.5],["been",178.5,178.72],["in",178.72,178.88],["official",178.88,179.26],["campaigns",179.26,179.88],["by",179.88,180.28],["governments",180.28,180.62],["and",180.62,181.0],["authorities",181.0,181.52],["who",181.52,182.2],["have",182.2,182.28],["quickly",182.28,182.64],["seen",182.64,182.94],["its",182.94,183.08],["potential.",183.08,183.54]]},{"start":184.12,"end":191.74,"text":"In Australia, the government developed a smart phone app called My Fit Buddy whose aim was to help people get off the sofa and exercise.","words":[["In",184.12,184.68],["Australia,",184.68,185.02],["the",185.54,185.66],["government",185.66,185.9],["developed",185.9,186.42],["a",186.42,186.58],["smart",186.58,186.84],["phone",186.84,187.14],["app",187.14,187.34],["called",187.34,187.56],["My",187.56,187.84],["Fit",187.84,188.12],["Buddy",188.12,188.38],["whose",188.38,189.02],["aim",189.02,189.36],["was",189.36,189.52],["to",189.52,189.66],["help",189.66,189.84],["people",189.84,190.16],["get",190.16,190.4],["off",190.4,190.54],["the",190.54,190.7],["sofa",190.7,190.98],["and",190.98,191.24],["exercise.",191.24,191.74]]},{"start":192.76,"end":199.74,"text":"The app provided plenty of motivational content to ensure people got the encouragement they needed to increase their levels of activity.","words":[["The",192.76,192.92],["app",192.92,193.04],["provided",193.04,193.56],["plenty",193.56,194.26],["of",194.26,194.5],["motivational",194.5,194.96],["content",194.96,195.52],["to",195.52,195.78],["ensure",195.78,196.1],["people",196.1,196.42],["got",196.42,196.7],["the",196.7,196.86],["encouragement",196.86,197.36],["they",197.36,197.68],["needed",197.68,197.96],["to",197.96,198.24],["increase",198.24,198.66],["their",198.66,198.92],["levels",198.92,199.18],["of",199.18,199.32],["activity.",199.32,199.74]]},{"start":200.76,"end":210.74,"text":"Overseas in one city, instead of just punishing the drivers caught driving too fast, a local authority conducted a trial where they rewarded good drivers with free entries into a draw.","words":[["Overseas",200.76,201.32],["in",201.32,201.5],["one",201.5,201.68],["city,",201.68,202.0],["instead",202.34,202.6],["of",202.6,202.78],["just",202.78,202.96],["punishing",202.96,203.34],["the",203.34,203.66],["drivers",203.66,203.96],["caught",203.96,204.22],["driving",204.22,204.6],["too",204.6,204.84],["fast,",204.84,205.26],["a",205.84,205.94],["local",205.94,206.14],["authority",206.14,206.58],["conducted",206.58,207.02],["a",207.02,207.24],["trial",207.24,207.5],["where",207.5,207.72],["they",207.72,207.84],["rewarded",207.84,208.32],["good",208.32,208.64],["drivers",208.64,209.02],["with",209.02,209.3],["free",209.3,209.58],["entries",209.58,210.02],["into",210.02,210.34],["a",210.34,210.5],["draw.",210.5,210.74]]},{"start":210.74,"end":216.48,"text":"The trial was so successful that it resulted in a 22% reduction in speeding.","words":[["The",210.74,211.64],["trial",211.64,211.94],["was",211.94,212.16],["so",212.16,212.42],["successful",212.42,212.98],["that",212.98,213.3],["it",213.3,213.42],["resulted",213.42,213.76],["in",213.76,214.08],["a",214.08,214.18],["22",214.18,214.62],["%",214.62,215.1],["reduction",215.1,215.72],["in",215.72,216.06],["speeding.",216.06,216.48]]},{"start":217.5,"end":221.96,"text":"Gamification is also playing its part in helping people make healthy choices.","words":[["Gamification",217.5,218.14],["is",218.14,218.7],["also",218.7,219.1],["playing",219.1,219.46],["its",219.46,219.66],["part",219.66,219.96],["in",219.96,220.18],["helping",220.18,220.5],["people",220.5,220.84],["make",220.84,221.16],["healthy",221.16,221.5],["choices.",221.5,221.96]]},{"start":223.08,"end":227.88,"text":"In an attempt to get commuters to walk instead of using the escalators in an underground station,","words":[["In",223.08,223.36],["an",223.36,223.48],["attempt",223.48,223.76],["to",223.76,224.04],["get",224.04,224.22],["commuters",224.22,224.66],["to",224.66,224.88],["walk",224.88,225.18],["instead",225.18,225.56],["of",225.56,225.76],["using",225.76,225.96],["the",225.96,226.14],["escalators",226.14,226.72],["in",226.72,226.9],["an",226.9,227.04],["underground",227.04,227.3],["station,",227.3,227.88]]},{"start":228.6,"end":231.62,"text":"the staircase next to it was transformed into a piano.","words":[["the",228.6,228.7],["staircase",228.7,229.02],["next",229.02,229.42],["to",229.42,229.62],["it",229.62,229.74],["was",229.74,230.2],["transformed",230.2,230.7],["into",230.7,231.18],["a",231.18,231.34],["piano.",231.34,231.62]]},{"start":232.56,"end":236.48,"text":"It had a touchpad underneath which played notes as people stepped on it.","words":[["It",232.56,232.88],["had",232.88,233.02],["a",233.02,233.12],["touchpad",233.12,233.6],["underneath",233.6,234.0],["which",234.0,234.64],["played",234.64,234.9],["notes",234.9,235.28],["as",235.28,235.52],["people",235.52,235.78],["stepped",235.78,236.12],["on",236.12,236.34],["it.",236.34,236.48]]},{"start":236.48,"end":242.5,"text":"When it was in use, almost everyone opted to use the stairs instead of the escalator.","words":[["When",236.48,237.54],["it",237.54,237.68],["was",237.68,237.84],["in",237.84,237.98],["use,",237.98,238.22],["almost",238.64,239.04],["everyone",239.04,239.74],["opted",239.74,240.2],["to",240.2,240.48],["use",240.48,240.74],["the",240.74,240.9],["stairs",240.9,241.32],["instead",241.32,241.74],["of",241.74,241.9],["the",241.9,242.0],["escalator.",242.0,242.5]]},{"start":243.72,"end":247.46,"text":"Another example is a medical research company in Australia.","words":[["Another",243.72,244.38],["example",244.38,244.92],["is",244.92,245.58],["a",245.58,245.68],["medical",245.68,246.02],["research",246.02,246.48],["company",246.48,246.94],["in",246.94,247.1],["Australia.",247.1,247.46]]},{"start":248.46,"end":253.82,"text":"They realised the potential of gamification to help the elderly recover much more quickly from accidents.","words":[["They",248.46,248.66],["realised",248.66,249.04],["the",249.04,249.3],["potential",249.3,249.7],["of",249.7,249.94],["gamification",249.94,250.44],["to",250.44,250.92],["help",250.92,251.14],["the",251.14,251.32],["elderly",251.32,251.68],["recover",251.68,252.22],["much",252.22,252.52],["more",252.52,252.84],["quickly",252.84,253.18],["from",253.18,253.44],["accidents.",253.44,253.82]]},{"start":254.82,"end":260.68,"text":"When the elderly fall, the most common injury is not to the arm or the leg but to the hand,","words":[["When",254.82,255.38],["the",255.38,255.48],["elderly",255.48,255.76],["fall,",255.76,256.28],["the",256.86,257.0],["most",257.0,257.2],["common",257.2,257.5],["injury",257.5,257.98],["is",257.98,258.2],["not",258.2,258.38],["to",258.38,258.56],["the",258.56,258.66],["arm",258.66,259.04],["or",259.04,259.24],["the",259.24,259.36],["leg",259.36,259.64],["but",259.64,259.96],["to",259.96,260.14],["the",260.14,260.22],["hand,",260.22,260.68]]},{"start":261.18,"end":265.3,"text":"so they took an already popular computer game which involved people smashing fruit","words":[["so",261.18,261.52],["they",261.52,261.66],["took",261.66,261.8],["an",261.8,261.96],["already",261.96,262.22],["popular",262.22,262.68],["computer",262.68,263.18],["game",263.18,263.46],["which",263.46,263.7],["involved",263.7,264.06],["people",264.06,264.44],["smashing",264.44,264.86],["fruit",264.86,265.3]]},{"start":265.3,"end":270.42,"text":"and adapted it so patients could practice their fine motor skills in a fun way.","words":[["and",265.3,266.12],["adapted",266.12,266.56],["it",266.56,266.82],["so",266.82,267.02],["patients",267.02,267.44],["could",267.44,267.72],["practice",267.72,268.12],["their",268.12,268.36],["fine",268.36,268.84],["motor",268.84,269.16],["skills",269.16,269.52],["in",269.52,269.68],["a",269.68,269.82],["fun",269.82,270.04],["way.",270.04,270.42]]},{"start":271.56,"end":275.16,"text":"Now, there are a number of things to consider when using gamification.","words":[["Now,",271.56,272.08],["there",272.44,272.7],["are",272.7,272.82],["a",272.82,272.92],["number",272.92,273.2],["of",273.2,273.4],["things",273.4,273.54],["to",273.54,273.72],["consider",273.72,274.08],["when",274.08,274.28],["using",274.28,274.62],["gamification.",274.62,275.16]]},{"start":276.0,"end":279.18,"text":"First of all, there is no way it can work unless it is fun.","words":[["First",276.0,276.32],["of",276.32,276.56],["all,",276.56,276.78],["there",277.18,277.28],["is",277.28,277.4],["no",277.4,277.58],["way",277.58,277.84],["it",277.84,278.0],["can",278.0,278.12],["work",278.12,278.4],["unless",278.4,278.64],["it",278.64,278.82],["is",278.82,278.92],["fun.",278.92,279.18]]},{"start":279.72,"end":284.02,"text":"In fact, without that element, it could have the complete opposite effect on the consumer.","words":[["In",279.72,279.84],["fact,",279.84,280.06],["without",280.12,280.36],["that",280.36,280.64],["element,",280.64,280.98],["it",281.46,281.66],["could",281.66,281.78],["have",281.78,281.98],["the",281.98,282.12],["complete",282.12,282.48],["opposite",282.48,282.88],["effect",282.88,283.26],["on",283.26,283.46],["the",283.46,283.56],["consumer.",283.56,284.02]]},{"start":284.78,"end":290.78,"text":"In addition, as companies are often obtaining a lot more personal information and data on their customers this way,","words":[["In",284.78,284.94],["addition,",284.94,285.24],["as",285.8,285.92],["companies",285.92,286.2],["are",286.2,286.46],["often",286.46,286.68],["obtaining",286.68,287.18],["a",287.18,287.38],["lot",287.38,287.58],["more",287.58,287.76],["personal",287.76,288.16],["information",288.16,288.7],["and",288.7,288.94],["data",288.94,289.24],["on",289.24,289.58],["their",289.58,289.74],["customers",289.74,290.2],["this",290.2,290.46],["way,",290.46,290.78]]},{"start":290.78,"end":296.0,"text":"They should always be mindful of their legal obligations in terms of legislation relating","words":[["They",290.78,291.5],["should",291.5,291.66],["always",291.66,291.98],["be",291.98,292.22],["mindful",292.22,292.5],["of",292.5,292.72],["their",292.72,292.84],["legal",292.84,293.12],["obligations",293.12,293.68],["in",293.68,294.1],["terms",294.1,294.34],["of",294.34,294.52],["legislation",294.52,295.1],["relating",295.1,296.0]]},{"start":296.0,"end":296.7,"text":"to privacy.","words":[["to",296.0,296.26],["privacy.",296.26,296.7]]},{"start":298.1,"end":303.1,"text":"So now it's over to you to think of other examples of gamification that you might have","words":[["So",298.1,298.66],["now",298.66,298.9],["it's",298.9,299.46],["over",299.46,299.64],["to",299.64,299.78],["you",299.78,299.92],["to",299.92,300.06],["think",300.06,300.22],["of",300.22,300.42],["other",300.42,300.74],["examples",300.74,301.18],["of",301.18,301.34],["gamification",301.34,301.78],["that",301.78,302.68],["you",302.68,302.8],["might",302.8,302.98],["have",302.98,303.1]]},{"start":303.1,"end":303.7,"text":"come across.","words":[["come",303.1,303.3],["across.",303.3,303.7]]},{"start":306.96,"end":309.14,"text":"That is the end of section 4.","words":[["That",306.96,307.48],["is",307.48,307.68],["the",307.68,307.84],["end",307.84,308.12],["of",308.12,308.3],["section",308.3,308.58],["4.",308.58,309.14]]},{"start":309.94,"end":313.04,"text":"You now have half a minute to check your answers.","words":[["You",309.94,310.18],["now",310.18,310.44],["have",310.44,310.74],["half",310.74,311.12],["a",311.12,311.3],["minute",311.3,311.58],["to",311.58,312.08],["check",312.08,312.38],["your",312.38,312.6],["answers.",312.6,313.04]]},{"start":343.67,"end":345.75,"text":"That is the end of the listening test.","words":[["That",343.67,343.97],["is",343.97,344.19],["the",344.19,344.35],["end",344.35,344.71],["of",344.71,344.91],["the",344.91,345.03],["listening",345.03,345.31],["test.",345.31,345.75]]},{"start":345.75,"end":352.27,"text":"You now have 10 minutes to transfer your answers to the listening answer sheet.","words":[["You",345.75,347.03],["now",347.03,347.29],["have",347.29,347.61],["10",